      en: ["Mahagi is located at an elevation of over 1,700 meters, resulting in a cool climate.", "The Mahagi-Border crossing is one of the busiest and most critical in Ituri province.", "The town is the seat of the Roman Catholic Diocese of Mahagi-Niangara.", "The local Alur language bridges the community with populations in Uganda.", "Mahagi is connected to the provincial capital of Bunia by a major road artery.", "The agricultural output of Mahagi supplies staple foods to much of the northeast region."],
